# Pairs with SplitCompletes. The freeze step records nothing: the source is
# never put into Reject, so the split never reaches its commit while the
# coordinator keeps retrying it.
MODULE: SplitCompletesFreezeNeverLands
TARGET: SplitCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the freeze step leaves the source accepting, so the split never reaches its commit
PERTURBS: SplitFreeze

--- FIND
    /\ ~Fenced(spCopy, s1)
    /\ sp' = "frozen"
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~Fenced(spCopy, s1)
\* MUTATION: the source never enters Reject.
    /\ sp' = "swept"
--- END
